        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Available now.\n\nPlease scroll down for VR tour. \n\nGet Let is delighted to bring this fully refurbished, highly impressive two bedroom penthouse apartment to the rental market. Extending 85 sq. m., this apartment has been renovated to a high standard, taking it from a regular city-center, three-bedroom to a spacious, luxurious two-bedroom, two-bathroom penthouse. The property boasts an architect-designed layout including engineered-wood flooring throughout, new bathrooms with heated towel rails and heated bathroom floors, pressurized water supply, app-controlled radiators, two spacious bedrooms, a new, high-spec kitchen and double/triple-glazed windows and doors which cut down city-center noise while keeping the apartment warm and cosy. The two balconies on either side offer splendid, private views out over the city. \n\nWestland Square is an unbeatably convenient address, a few minutes` walk to Trinity College and Grafton Street and is near an abundance of restaurants, pubs, gyms and venues. A Tesco Metro and the side entrance to Pearse Street Dart Station round out the offering and are located across the street from the main gates. To arrange a viewing of this property please email Diana Farkas of Get Let and submit a detailed application. . Get Let is a subsidiary of Get Property Limited, fully licensed by the PSRA (002324)."
